<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>마이페이지 - 프레시 마켓</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./stylesheets/style.css">
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; background-color: #f9fafb; color: #111827; }
        header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 18px 40px; background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; }
        .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 35px; }
        .header-left h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.4em; font-weight: 800; color: #10b981; }
        nav { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
        nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95em; }
        .auth-zone { font-size: 0.9em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .auth-zone a { color: #4b5563; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
        .user-tag { font-weight: 600; color: #047857; background-color: #ecfdf5; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; }

        .mypage-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 40px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); }
        .mypage-title { font-size: 1.6em; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; border-bottom: 2px solid #f3f4f6; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f9fafb; font-size: 1em; }
        .info-label { color: #4b5563; font-weight: 600; }
        .info-value { color: #111827; font-weight: 700; }
        .btn-home { display: block; text-align: center; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 14px; background-color: #10b981; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 30px; }
        .btn-home:hover { background-color: #059669; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="header-left">
        <h1>🌱 프레시 마켓</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="./">홈</a>
            <a href="./shop/products">추천상품</a>
            <a href="./shop/products/all">전체상품</a>
            <a href="./shop/cart">장바구니</a>
            <a href="./post/list">고객센터</a>
        </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="auth-zone">
        <% if (user) { %>
            <span class="user-tag">👤 <%= user.username || user.id %>님</span> |
            <a href="./mypage" style="color: #10b981; font-weight: 700;">마이페이지</a> |
            <a href="./logout" style="color: #ef4444;">로그아웃</a>
        <% } else { %>
            <a href="./login">로그인</a> |
            <a href="./register">회원가입</a>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <div class="mypage-container">
        <h2 class="mypage-title">👤 마이페이지 정보 조회</h2>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">고객 고유 번호 (ID)</span>
            <span class="info-value" style="color: #10b981;"><%= user.id %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">사용자 이름 (Username)</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= user.username || '미지정' %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">가입 상태</span>
            <span class="info-value" style="background-color: #eff6ff; color: #2563eb; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.85em;">정상 활성 회원</span>
        </div>

        <a href="./" class="btn-home">쇼핑몰 메인으로 돌아가기</a>
    </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>